(fragment (groups-disjoint (?L relation) (?S relation) (?keys columns ?L) (?a column ?L) (?others columns ?S) (?b column ?S))
  "Whether both relations hold a set of cells, and no set of the first is a set of the second."
  (INIT &left_ids Quotient
    (equivalent ((:a ?keys) (:b ?keys))
